{"path":"utility/functional/move_only_function/operator()","title":"std::move_only_function::operator()","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::move_only_function::</span>operator()","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/move_only_function/operator()","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Invokes the stored callable target with the parameters args. The /*cv*/, /*ref*/, and /*noex*/ parts of operator() are identical to those of the template parameter of std::move_only_function.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">R operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> Args... <span class=\"me1\">args</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*cv*/</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*ref*/</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*noex*/</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Invokes the stored callable target with the parameters <code>args</code>. The <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*cv*/</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*ref*/</span></span></code>, and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*noex*/</span></span></code> parts of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> are identical to those of the template parameter of <code>std::move_only_function</code>.\n</p><p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/invoke\"><span class=\"kw3649\">std::<span class=\"me2\">invoke_r</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*cv-ref-cast*/</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Args<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args<span class=\"br0\">)</span>...<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>, where <code>f</code> is a cv-unqualified lvalue that denotes the target object of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>, and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*cv-ref-cast*/</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is equivalent to:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">f</span></code> if <span class=\"t-spar\">cv</span> <span class=\"t-spar\">ref</span> is either empty or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span></span></code>, or\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/as_const\"><span class=\"kw1129\">std::<span class=\"me2\">as_const</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> if <span class=\"t-spar\">cv</span> <span class=\"t-spar\">ref</span> is either <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span></span></code>, or\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> if <span class=\"t-spar\">cv</span> <span class=\"t-spar\">ref</span> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span></span></code>, or\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/as_const\"><span class=\"kw1129\">std::<span class=\"me2\">as_const</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> if <span class=\"t-spar\">cv</span> <span class=\"t-spar\">ref</span> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span></span></code>.\n</li></ul>\n<p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is empty.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  args\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  parameters to pass to the stored callable target\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/invoke\"><span class=\"kw3649\">std::<span class=\"me2\">invoke_r</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*cv-ref-cast*/</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Args<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args<span class=\"br0\">)</span>...<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Propagates the exception thrown by the underlying function call.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>The following example shows how <span class=\"t-lc\">std::move_only_function</span> can passed to other functions by value. Also, it shows how <span class=\"t-lc\">std::move_only_function</span> can store lambdas.</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;functional&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> call<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/move_only_function\"><span class=\"kw1068\">std::<span class=\"me2\">move_only_function</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> f<span class=\"br0\">)</span>  <span class=\"co1\">// can be passed by value</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span> \n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> f<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> normal_function<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> lambda <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>n<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> n<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/move_only_function\"><span class=\"kw1068\">std::<span class=\"me2\">move_only_function</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> f <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> lambda<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    call<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    call<span class=\"br0\">(</span>lambda<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> \n&nbsp;\n    f <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> normal_function<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> \n    call<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>1\n2\n42</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function/operator()\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes the target <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::function&lt;R(Args...)&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/reference_wrapper/operator()\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  calls the stored function <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::reference_wrapper&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/invoke\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>invoke</span><span>invoke_r</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes any <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Callable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Callable</em></a> object with given arguments <span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx23\"><span>and possibility to specify return type</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span></span></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/functional","title":"Function objects"},{"path":"utility/functional/move_only_function","title":"std::move_only_function"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::move_only_function::operator()","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Invokes the stored callable target with the parameters args."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"args"},{"label":"Return value","note":"std::invoke_r<R>(/*cv-ref-cast*/(f), std::forward<Args>(args)...)."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Propagates the exception thrown by the underlying function call."},{"label":"Example","note":"The following example shows how std::move_only_function can passed to other functions by value."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator()","note":"invokes the target"},{"label":"operator()","note":"calls the stored function"},{"label":"invoke, invoke_r","note":"invokes any Callable object with given arguments and possibility to specify return type(since C++23)"}]}]},"standards":["C++17","C++23"],"wordCount":248,"codeBlockCount":2}
